# A road drawn across a tree node is accepted.
# Run it on the woodcutter layout:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh road-tree --layout layouts/woodcutter.jsonc --fps 30
# The road runs from the hut's flag at 14,11 east across the tree at 17,11, then turns to a flag at 16,12.
expect-at 17 11 tree
wait 0.3
button Flag
click-tile 16 12
button Flag
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 14 11
click-tile 15 11
click-tile 16 11
click-tile 17 11
click-tile 17 12
click-tile 16 12
button Road
wait 0.3
shot built 16 11 3 2
expect-at 17 11 road
expect-at 17 11 tree
list built
